        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In one study, proofreaders caught more typos at the start and end than in the middle.",
      "start": 4.75,
      "end": 9.235,
      "pauses": [
        [
          5.525,
          5.86
        ],
        [
          8.523,
          8.665
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Other studies found people stuck with goals more when they watched the smaller number.",
      "start": 9.75,
      "end": 13.952,
      "pauses": [
        [
          10.498,
          10.63
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "text": "Early on, that's what's done. Near the end, it's what's left. Progress feels faster.",
      "start": 14.5,
      "end": 19.174,
      "pauses": [
        [
          15.86,
          16.213
        ],
        [
          17.563,
          17.849
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff",
      "text": "So at first, count what you've done. Past halfway, count what's left.",
